This package contains the runtime code for the Cue models. The code is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE). The model weights are not part of this
package: they are downloaded from Hugging Face (IOTEverythin/cue-tiny, IOTEverythin/cue-v4,
IOTEverythin/cue-v3), and each model repository states its own licence and notices.

Third-party code:

src/cue_turn/audio.py (StreamResampler)
    A numpy port of the default sinc-interpolation resampler of torchaudio
    (torchaudio.functional.resample), BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2017 Facebook Inc.
    (Soumith Chintala). https://github.com/pytorch/audio
    Its licence: licenses/torchaudio-BSD-2-Clause.txt

src/cue_turn/model.py
    Uses the encoder of OpenAI Whisper small (Apache-2.0) through Hugging Face
    transformers (Apache-2.0); Whisper's log-mel front end is reimplemented in torch.

src/cue_turn/pipecat.py
    Builds on Pipecat (BSD-2-Clause, Copyright (c) 2024-2026 Daily), which it imports and
    does not include. https://github.com/pipecat-ai/pipecat
